[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6373.91, "timestamp": "01:46:13", "text": "可以結束了。  哦，這裡沒有表達情感之類的功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6377.83, "timestamp": "01:46:17", "text": "不。這怎麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6380.07, "timestamp": "01:46:20", "text": "可能？  這到底是怎麼運作的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6383.75, "timestamp": "01:46:23", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6393.99, "timestamp": "01:46:33", "text": "是的，我們幾乎就要成功了，結果卻被彈了回去。是不是因為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6396.47, "timestamp": "01:46:36", "text": "鏈條阻礙了它，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6398.87, "timestamp": "01:46:38", "text": "我不知道。有可能。  也可能是鏈條的問題。  我受夠了。"}]